// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`templates > account-deleted > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Glideworth workspace has been deleted

Glideworth

Your workspace has been deleted

Hello Sam Example,

Your workspace "Sample household" was deleted on 16 November 2026.

We deleted its live database at once and destroyed the key that encrypts its backups, so every backup copy is now unreadable.

The encrypted backup files are removed from storage by 16 December 2026.

If you did not ask for this, write to support@example.test straight away.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > checkin-summary > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Your scheduled Glideworth check-in is ready

Glideworth

Your check-in is ready

Hello,

Your scheduled check-in has finished. We checked 3 plans.

What changed:

- The chance of success moved on at least one plan.
- A milestone slipped on at least one plan.
- At least one plan is behind plan.
- There is a new assumption finding.

See the details:
https://app.example.test/checkins/latest?t=sample-token

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
You get this because check-in emails are switched on. Unsubscribe: https://app.example.test/email/unsubscribe?t=sample-token
"
`;

exports[`templates > deletion-warning > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Glideworth workspace will be deleted

Glideworth

Your workspace will be deleted

Hello Sam Example,

Your workspace "Sample household" has no active subscription. It will be deleted on 16 November 2027, in 30 days, together with everything in it.

Subscribing again before that date keeps the workspace and everything in it.

Subscribe to keep your workspace:
https://app.example.test/billing?t=sample-token

Or download a copy of your data first:
https://app.example.test/settings/workspace?t=sample-token

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > email-change-confirm > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Confirm your new email address

Glideworth

Confirm your new email address

Hello Sam Example,

You asked to change the email address on your Glideworth account to sam.new@example.test. Please confirm that this address is yours.

Confirm new email address:
https://app.example.test/confirm-email?t=sample-token

This link works for 24 hours. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email and nothing will change.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > email-change-requested > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Someone asked to change your Glideworth email address

Glideworth

A change of email address was requested

Hello Sam Example,

On 16 November 2026, 09:14 UTC, someone signed in to your Glideworth account asked to change its email address to sam.new@example.test.

Nothing has changed yet. The change happens only if the confirmation link we sent to sam.new@example.test is opened within 24 hours. Until then, this address stays on the account.

If you asked for this, there is nothing to do.

If you did not, change your password now (that also cancels the request), then contact us:
https://app.example.test/settings/security?t=sample-token

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > export-ready > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Glideworth export is ready

Glideworth

Your export is ready

Hello Sam Example,

The export of your workspace is ready. It is a copy of your data that you can run yourself.

Download your export:
https://app.example.test/exports/sample?t=sample-token

The link can be used once and expires at 17 November 2026, 09:14 UTC. You need to be signed in to download it.

If you did not ask for an export, change your password and contact us.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > invitation > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: You have been invited to a Glideworth workspace

Glideworth

You have been invited to a workspace

Robin Sample has invited you to join the workspace "Sample household" on Glideworth as an editor, who can change plans and settings.

View the invitation:
https://app.example.test/invitations/accept?t=sample-token

The invitation expires in 7 days. You need a Glideworth account with this email address to accept it; if you do not have one yet, you can create one first.

If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this email.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > member-removed > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: You have been removed from a Glideworth workspace

Glideworth

You have been removed from a workspace

Hello Sam Example,

The owner of the Glideworth workspace "Sample household" has removed you from it. You can no longer see or change its plans.

Your own Glideworth account is not affected: you can still sign in, and you can create a workspace of your own or join another one you are invited to.

If you think this was a mistake, ask the workspace owner to invite you again.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > password-reset > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Reset your Glideworth password

Glideworth

Reset your password

Hello Sam Example,

We received a request to reset the password for your Glideworth account.

Choose a new password:
https://app.example.test/reset?t=sample-token

This link works for 30 minutes and can be used once. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email and your password will stay as it is.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > password-setup > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Set a password for your Glideworth account

Glideworth

Set a password for your Glideworth account

Hello Sam Example,

You asked to set a password for your Glideworth account. You sign in with Google today; with a password you can also confirm changes that need a recent check, such as creating an API key.

Set your password:
https://app.example.test/set-password?t=sample-token

This link works for 30 minutes and can be used once. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email and nothing will change.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > payment-problem > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Action needed: your Glideworth payment did not go through

Glideworth

Your payment did not go through

Hello Sam Example,

We could not take your latest payment for Glideworth. This is usually an expired card or a bank block.

Update your payment details:
https://app.example.test/billing/portal?t=sample-token

If this is not sorted out by 30 November 2026, your workspace will become read-only: you will still be able to look at your plans and export your data, but not change them. Nothing is deleted.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

