exports[`templates > renewal-reminder > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Glideworth subscription renews soon

Glideworth

Your subscription renews soon

Hello Sam Example,

Your annual subscription renews on 30 November 2026. The payment method on your account will be charged then.

You can see the amount, change your payment method or cancel before that date on your billing page. If you cancel, you keep access until the end of the period you have paid for.

If you are charged and do not want the renewal, you can ask for a full refund within 14 days of the charge.

Open your billing page:
https://app.example.test/billing?t=sample-token

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

exports[`templates > second-factor-failures > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: Someone is guessing your Glideworth two-step code

Glideworth

Change your password now

Hello Sam Example,

Someone entered the wrong two-step code 10 times. They have your password. Change it now.

The last wrong code was entered at 16 November 2026, 09:14 UTC.

Reset your password:
https://app.example.test/forgot-password?t=sample-token

A new password stops them trying again and signs out every other device. The wrong codes kept them out, so they have not signed in with them.

Check your security settings and signed-in devices:
https://app.example.test/settings/security?t=sample-token

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

