exports[`templates > signup-existing-account > text snapshot 1`] = `
"Subject: You already have a Glideworth account

Glideworth

You already have an account

Someone, probably you, tried to sign up to Glideworth with this email address. There is already an account for it, so we did not create a new one.

Sign in:
https://app.example.test/signin?t=sample-token

If you have forgotten your password, you can reset it here:
https://app.example.test/forgot?t=sample-token

If this was not you, you do not need to do anything. Your account has not been changed.

--
Glideworth
Questions? Write to support@example.test.
This is a service email about your account, so you cannot unsubscribe from it.
"
`;

